---
layout: base
title: Home | Travelling Trails
---
{# Featured story cards remain curated; the cover always chooses the newest published featured article. #}
{% set featuredList = collections.homeFeatured if collections.homeFeatured.length >= 3 else collections.homeRecent %}
{% set heroPost = collections.homeFeatured[0] if collections.homeFeatured.length > 0 else collections.homeRecent[0] %}
<div class="tt-home">
  <section class="tt-hero" aria-label="Welcome to Travelling Trails">
    {% if heroPost and (heroPost.data.featuredImage or heroPost.data.thumbnailImage) %}
      <img class="tt-hero-photo" src="{{ (heroPost.data.featuredImage or heroPost.data.thumbnailImage) | url }}" alt="{{ heroPost.data.imageAlt or heroPost.data.title }}" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    {% endif %}
    <div class="tt-hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="tt-hero-inner tt-shell">
      <div class="tt-hero-copy">
        <p class="tt-hero-overline"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Discover. Wander. Repeat.</p>
        <h1>Take the<br><span>scenic route.</span></h1>
        <p class="tt-hero-description">Real roads. Unforgettable views. Stories from the journeys that make us feel alive.</p>
        <div class="tt-hero-actions">
          <a class="tt-pill tt-pill-light" href="{{ '/blog/' | url }}">Explore stories <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></a>
          <a class="tt-pill tt-pill-glass" href="{{ '/explore/' | url }}">Find destinations <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% if heroPost %}
      <a class="tt-hero-feature" href="{{ heroPost.url | url }}">
        <span>Featured journey</span>
        <strong>{{ heroPost.data.destination or heroPost.data.title }}</strong>
        <span class="tt-hero-feature-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="tt-shell">
    <section class="tt-section tt-featured-section" aria-labelledby="tt-featured-title">
      <div class="tt-section-top">
        <div><p class="tt-eyebrow">The stories</p><h2 id="tt-featured-title">Beyond the ordinary.</h2></div>
        <div class="tt-section-aside"><p>A collection of journeys, roads less travelled, and moments worth remembering.</p><a class="tt-inline-link" href="{{ '/blog/' | url }}">View all stories <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tt-feature-layout">
        {% for post in featuredList | limit(3) %}
          <div class="tt-feature-cell{% if loop.first %} tt-feature-cell-large{% endif %}">{% include "components/blog-card.njk" %}</div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    {% if collections.destinations.length > 0 %}
    <section class="tt-section tt-destinations-section" aria-labelledby="tt-destinations-title">
      <div class="tt-section-top">
        <div><p class="tt-eyebrow">Find your next detour</p><h2 id="tt-destinations-title">Places worth the journey.</h2></div>
        <div class="tt-section-aside"><p>From misty mountain roads to quiet coastal escapes — discover destinations through real stories.</p><a class="tt-inline-link" href="{{ '/explore/' | url }}">Discover more <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tt-destinations-grid">
        {% for destination in collections.destinations | limit(4) %}
          {% set destinationLink = '/destinations/' + destination.slug + '/' %}
          <a class="tt-destination-tile" href="{{ destinationLink | url }}">
            {% if destination.posts[0] and (destination.posts[0].data.featuredImage or destination.posts[0].data.thumbnailImage) %}
              <img src="{{ (destination.posts[0].data.featuredImage or destination.posts[0].data.thumbnailImage) | url }}" alt="Explore {{ destination.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            {% endif %}
            <span class="tt-destination-shade"></span>
            <span class="tt-destination-label"><small>{{ destination.count }} {% if destination.count == 1 %}story{% else %}stories{% endif %}</small><strong>{{ destination.title }}</strong></span>
            <span class="tt-destination-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <section class="tt-statement">
    <div class="tt-shell tt-statement-inner">
      <p class="tt-eyebrow">More than a destination</p>
      <h2>The journey is<br>the best part.</h2>
      <p>We're here for the turns you didn't plan, the views that make you stop, and the stories you bring home.</p>
      <a class="tt-pill tt-pill-dark" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Our story <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="tt-shell">
    <section class="tt-section tt-journal-section" aria-labelledby="tt-journal-title">
      <div class="tt-section-top">
        <div><p class="tt-eyebrow">Fresh from the road</p><h2 id="tt-journal-title">The travel journal.</h2></div>
        <div class="tt-section-aside"><p>Honest experiences, practical details, and a little inspiration for your next escape.</p><a class="tt-inline-link" href="{{ '/blog/' | url }}">Browse the journal <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tt-story-grid">
        {% for post in collections.paginatedPosts | limit(6) %}{% include "components/blog-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tt-newsletter" aria-labelledby="tt-newsletter-heading">
      <div class="tt-newsletter-copy">
        <p class="tt-eyebrow">Letters from the road</p>
        <h2 id="tt-newsletter-heading">Good stories. Straight to your inbox.</h2>
        <p>New adventures, favourite routes, and places we can't stop thinking about.</p>
      </div>
      <form name="newsletter" method="POST" action="{{ '/success/' | url }}" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="tt-newsletter-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter">
        <p class="hidden"><label>Leave this field empty: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
        <label class="sr-only" for="tt-email">Email address</label>
        <input id="tt-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email" autocomplete="email" required>
        <button class="tt-pill tt-pill-dark" type="submit">Join the journey <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="tt-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M7 5h12v12"/></svg></span></button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
